# Project state

- Read AGENTS.md and docs/PROJECT_STATE.md before work; Android has separate instructions.
- A version string or source/docs commit is not a verified binary release.
- Record actual source/build SHA, artifact hashes, tests, skips and limits.
- Keep Windows, Publisher and Android versions and channel results separate.
- Do not turn emulator or handshake checks into physical-device/media/Doze claims.
- Preserve unrelated work, Staging, profiles, keys and immutable packages.
- Keep README, guides and changelogs consistent; documentation changes need no rebuild.
- Private records, credentials, personal correspondence and raw logs stay outside Git.
